flowchart LR
    C[Clinic JSON files] --> G[GCS by clinic and date]
    G --> E[Object arrival events]
    E --> Q[Pub Sub queue]
    Q --> W[Cloud Run workers]
    CFG[Versioned configuration] --> W
    W --> V[Parse and map fields]
    V --> N[Normalise names and units]
    N --> F[Validate and flag]
    F --> B[BigQuery staging]
    B --> M[Merge by stable record ID]
    M --> DB[Canonical observations and records]
    W --> DL[Dead letter storage]
    DL --> R[Correct config and replay]
    R --> Q
    G --> RAW[Retained raw input]
    DB --> API[Read API]
    RAW --> API
    API --> UI[Next.js operations UI]
    W --> O[Structured logs and metrics]
    O --> A[Cloud Monitoring alerts]
